From 397b6c6c00813a609c558a38d96d1e61a70c31b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:54:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/45] Modern abilities, batch 3: the remaining complex
 abilities

- Prankster (+1 priority to status moves; Dark types immune), Magic
  Bounce, Infiltrator (screens, Mist, Safeguard, Substitute), Mold Breaker,
  Unburden, Pickpocket (battle-only steal), Harvest, Forewarn,
  Anticipation, Imposter, Neutralizing Gas, Protean (once per switch-in),
  Leaf Guard
- Every new ability except Honey Gather is now in use

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
